     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m trying to annotate clades of a circular plot.  I would like to find a way to automatically orient the labels to be parallel (tangent) to the circle.  As it stands, it seems like I&#39;ll have to manually tweak each clade label&#39;s angle depending on where it happens to fall along the circle.  Any ideas of how to make a parallel/tangent orientation work?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks.</div><div>Allie<br><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;overflow:auto;padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;background:0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit\"><span style=\"color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\">nwk &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">system.file</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;extdata&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;sample.nwk&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(144,32,0)\">package=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;treeio&quot;</span>)</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\">\r\n</span></font><span style=\"color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html#cb188-2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html%23cb188-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482198245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-09Bt4WdEc8Fdbxk1jQZc\"></a></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\">\r\n</span></font><span style=\"color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html#cb188-3\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html%23cb188-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482198245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FCLKDE6bCVeE8HtFeYs0K\"></a>tree &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">read.tree</span>(nwk)</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\">\r\n</span></font><span style=\"color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html#cb188-4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html%23cb188-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482198245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RDT3bOFxdjcUrIuGggwla\"></a>circ &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">ggtree</span>(tree, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(144,32,0)\">layout =</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;circular&quot;</span>)</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\">\r\n</span></font><span style=\"color:inherit;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html#cb188-5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html%23cb188-5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482198245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oaOR_aWqngw4y_ohPaFjX\"></a></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\">\r\n</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.6px;letter-spacing:0.2px\">circ + geom_cladelabel(19, &quot;taxa1&quot;) + geom_cladelabel(21, &quot;taxa2&quot;)</span></font><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:0.85em;letter-spacing:0.2px\"><br></span></font></code></pre><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/3ccf2cc213027/2019-09-13%2012_11_14-RStudio.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"2019-09-13 12_11_14-RStudio.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"320\" height=\"308\"></p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;overflow:auto;padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;background:0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:13.6px;letter-spacing:0.2px\"><br></span></font></code></pre></div></div></div>"
